WEBVTT

01:03:57.250 --> 01:04:00.143
"Look, I'm committed enough
to this person or system

01:04:00.167 --> 01:04:03.018
that I'm just going to grit
my teeth and bear it."

01:04:03.042 --> 01:04:06.434
And I think that there's a progression
that we all need to go through

01:04:06.458 --> 01:04:08.018
when we're considering leaving,

01:04:08.042 --> 01:04:10.851
which is to say,
have I been loyal long enough

01:04:10.875 --> 01:04:14.101
that I've given the person or the place
a chance to change?

01:04:14.125 --> 01:04:17.601
And then, once I've done that,
have I tried to change it

01:04:17.625 --> 01:04:19.851
and have I made
my best effort at doing that?

01:04:19.875 --> 01:04:22.101
And if not, it's probably time to go.

01:04:22.125 --> 01:04:24.518
EP: So the interesting thing
about your framework

01:04:24.542 --> 01:04:26.625
is that they all put
the eye at the center.

01:04:27.708 --> 01:04:29.934
What is the circumstances of this?

01:04:29.958 --> 01:04:32.268
You know, do you decide?